{
  "key": 62160,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_HelloThere",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there!\n",
        "It’s so very nice to meet you!\r",
        "Welcome to the world of Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour!\n",
        "Quelle joie de te rencontrer!\r",
        "Bienvenue dans le monde des Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_MyNameRowan",
      "en_US": [
        "My name is Rowan.\r",
        "However, everyone just calls me\n",
        "the Pokémon Professor.\r",
        "Before I go any further, is this\n",
        "your first adventure?\r",
        "If you need advice, I’m certainly\n",
        "capable of giving it.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mon nom est Sorbier.\r",
        "Mais tout le monde m’appelle\n",
        "simplement le Professeur Pokémon.\r",
        "Avant de commencer, est-ce ta première\n",
        "aventure?\r",
        "Si tu as besoin de conseils, je suis tout\n",
        "à fait apte à t’en donner.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfo0",
      "en_US": [
        "Moves the main character.\n",
        "Also used to choose various\n",
        "headings and selections.\n",
        "\n",
        "Used to confirm a choice, check\n",
        "things, chat, and scroll text.\n",
        "\n",
        "Used to exit, cancel a choice,\n",
        "and cancel a mode."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Déplacer le personnage.\n",
        "Faire une sélection.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Confirmer un choix, examiner,\n",
        "parler et faire défiler le texte.\n",
        "\n",
        "Quitter, annuler un choix ou\n",
        "un mode."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfo1",
      "en_US": [
        "Press to open the menu.\n",
        "\n",
        "Press to use an item, such\n",
        "as a Bicycle, that has been\n",
        "registered in advance."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Appuyer pour ouvrir le menu.\n",
        "\n",
        "Appuyer pour utiliser un objet,\n",
        "tel que la Bicyclette, ayant été\n",
        "enregistré."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfo2",
      "en_US": [
        "The lower screen is called\n",
        "the Touch Screen.\n",
        "\n",
        "The Touch Screen will display\n",
        "a variety of touch buttons\n",
        "depending on the situation."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "L’écran du bas est appelé\n",
        "l’écran tactile.\n",
        "\n",
        "L’écran tactile affichera toutes\n",
        "sortes de boutons tactiles selon\n",
        "la situation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfo3",
      "en_US": [
        "If this mark is shown in the\n",
        "message window, there are active\n",
        "buttons you can touch on the\n",
        "Touch Screen below."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Si ce symbole apparaît dans la\n",
        "fenêtre de message, cela signifie\n",
        "qu’il y a des boutons qu’on peut\n",
        "toucher sur l’écran tactile."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfoDsIcon",
      "en_US": "{YESNO 0}",
      "fr_FR": "{YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfoUnderstood",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you understand everything\n",
        "so far?{YESNO 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tout te semble clair pour le\n",
        "moment?{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ControlInfoUseTouchscreen",
      "en_US": [
        "Please touch a button on the\n",
        "Touch Screen below.{YESNO 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Touche un bouton de l’écran\n",
        "tactile ci-dessous.{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_InfoAnythingElse",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to know more about\n",
        "anything else?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Souhaites-tu savoir autre chose?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AdventureInfo0",
      "en_US": [
        "You are about to enter a world\n",
        "where you will embark on a grand\n",
        "adventure of your very own."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Prépare-toi à te lancer dans une\n",
        "grande aventure, à la découverte\n",
        "d’un nouveau monde."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AdventureInfo1",
      "en_US": [
        "Speak to people and check things\n",
        "wherever you go, be it in towns,\n",
        "roads, or caves.\n",
        "Gather information and hints from\n",
        "every possible source."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu vas faire de nouvelles\n",
        "rencontres et découvrir de\n",
        "nouvelles villes.\n",
        "Profites-en pour récolter autant\n",
        "d’informations que possible."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AdventureInfo2",
      "en_US": [
        "New paths will open to you when\n",
        "you help people in need, overcome\n",
        "challenges, and solve mysteries."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "En résolvant des mystères et en\n",
        "aidant les gens, tu pourras ouvrir\n",
        "de nouvelles voies."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AdventureInfo3",
      "en_US": [
        "At times, you will be challenged\n",
        "by others to a battle.\n",
        "At other times, wild creatures\n",
        "may stand in your way.\n",
        "\n",
        "By overcoming such hurdles,\n",
        "you will gain great power."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Attends-toi à te faire défier par\n",
        "de nombreux Dresseurs et à\n",
        "affronter des créatures sauvages.\n",
        "Sois brave et ne perds pas espoir.\n",
        "\n",
        "En surmontant de telles épreuves,\n",
        "tu gagneras en puissance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AdventureInfo4",
      "en_US": [
        "However, your adventure is not\n",
        "solely about becoming powerful."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mais tu t’apercevras que ce n’est\n",
        "pas une simple question de force."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AdventureInfo5",
      "en_US": [
        "On your travels, we hope that\n",
        "you will meet countless people\n",
        "and, through them, achieve\n",
        "personal growth.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the most important\n",
        "objective of this adventure."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Nous espérons que tu rencontreras\n",
        "toutes sortes de gens pendant ce\n",
        "voyage et que tu apprendras à\n",
        "mieux te connaître.\n",
        "\n",
        "C’est notre objectif principal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_WidelyInhabited",
      "en_US": [
        "This world is widely inhabited by\n",
        "creatures known as Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce monde est peuplé de créatures\n",
        "appelées Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_HavePokeBall",
      "en_US": [
        "Here, I have a Poké Ball.\r",
        "Touch the button on the middle of\n",
        "the Poké Ball, if you’d please.{YESNO 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tiens, voilà une Poké Ball.\r",
        "Touche le bouton au milieu de la\n",
        "Poké Ball, s’il te plaît.{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_PokeBallUseTouchscreen",
      "en_US": [
        "No, no! Not that button!\n",
        "The button on the Poké Ball.{YESNO 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Non, pas ce bouton!\n",
        "Le bouton sur la Poké Ball.{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_LiveAlongsidePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "We humans live alongside Pokémon\n",
        "as friends.\r",
        "At times we play together,\n",
        "and at other times we\f",
        "work together.\r",
        "Some people use their Pokémon\n",
        "to battle and develop\f",
        "closer bonds with them.\r",
        "What do I do?\r",
        "I conduct research so that we may\n",
        "learn more about Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Nous, les humains, vivons avec les\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "Il nous arrive de jouer\n",
        "ou de travailler ensemble.\r",
        "Certaines personnes utilisent les\n",
        "Pokémon pour combattre et créent\f",
        "un lien très fort avec eux.\r",
        "Moi?\r",
        "Je me contente de faire des\n",
        "recherches, pour que nous en\f",
        "sachions plus sur les Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_AboutYourself",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, why don’t you tell me\n",
        "a little bit about yourself?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mais avant tout, parle-moi\n",
        "un peu de toi.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_GenderDialogue",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you a boy?\n",
        "Or are you a girl?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Es-tu un garçon?\n",
        "Ou bien une fille?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ConfirmBoy",
      "en_US": "All right, so you’re a boy?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Tu es donc un garçon?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ConfirmGirl",
      "en_US": "All right, so you’re a girl?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Tu es donc une fille?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_NameDialogue",
      "en_US": "Tell me, what is your name?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Comment t’appelles-tu?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ConfirmNameMale",
      "en_US": "Your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Tu t’appelles {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ConfirmNameFemale",
      "en_US": "Your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Tu t’appelles {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_SoYoure",
      "en_US": [
        "OK...\n",
        "So, you’re {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "A fine name that is!\r",
        "Now, this boy here...\n",
        "I believe he’s your friend.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "OK...\n",
        "Donc, tu t’appelles {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "Quel beau nom tu as!\r",
        "Alors, ce garçon, là...\n",
        "fait partie de tes amis.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_RivalNameDialogue",
      "en_US": "What might his name be?\r",
      "fr_FR": "Quel est son nom?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ConfirmRivalName",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That’s your friend’s name?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?\n",
        "C’est ainsi que ton ami s’appelle?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_EndDialogue",
      "en_US": [
        "All right, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, the time\n",
        "has come.\r",
        "Your very own tale of grand\n",
        "adventure is about to unfold.\r",
        "On your journey, you will meet\n",
        "countless Pokémon and people.\r",
        "I’m sure that along the way you will\n",
        "discover many things, perhaps even\f",
        "something about yourself.\r",
        "Now, go on, leap into the world of\n",
        "Pokémon!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le moment est venu, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Bon, comment te sens-tu?\n",
        "Tu es sur le point d’embarquer\f",
        "pour une aventure unique.\r",
        "Tu rencontreras une multitude de\n",
        "gens et de Pokémon en cours de route.\r",
        "Tu vas découvrir un tas de choses,\n",
        "tu apprendras aussi certainement\f",
        "des choses sur toi-même.\r",
        "Allez, plonge dans le monde des\n",
        "Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ChoiceControlInfo",
      "en_US": "CONTROL INFO",
      "fr_FR": "INFOS COMMANDES"
    },
    {
      "id": "RowanIntro_Text_ChoiceAdventureInfo",
      "en_US": "ADVENTURE INFO",
      "fr_FR": "INFOS AVENTURE"
    },
